  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing Access to Renewable Energy Project (Additional Financing) under PREIF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to help the Government of Tuvalu expand access to modern energy; improve service quality, reliability, and climate resilience; reduce reliance on fossil fuels for power generation; and reduce the cost of power generation. These will be achieved by replacing diesel power with solar power in Funafuti and three outer islands, and by installing a large battery energy storage system (BESS) in Funafuti.</narrative>
  </description>
